WEBVTT

00:01.042 --> 00:03.253
[Gil-su] Hey, where's
that other punk? Huh?

00:03.336 --> 00:06.172
- Is that little asshole bringing the cops?
- [Beom-seok panting]

00:06.715 --> 00:08.341
[tense music playing]

00:08.425 --> 00:10.510
You dumb little high school bitch.
I got ya.

00:11.761 --> 00:13.596
- [boy 1 grunts]
- [Gil-su] Hey.

00:13.680 --> 00:14.889
- Faster.
- [boy 1] It's heavy.

00:14.973 --> 00:17.434
- [Gil-su] You got the paperwork?
- [boy 2] I brought everything.

00:17.517 --> 00:19.561
- [Gil-su] Then hurry up.
- [tape rustling]

00:20.729 --> 00:22.605
[sirens approaching]

00:32.782 --> 00:34.659
Hey, hey, hey. Hurry up.

00:34.743 --> 00:36.161
- [boy 2] Oh shit.
- [Gil-su] Hurry up!

00:36.661 --> 00:38.538
[boy 3] Shit, shit! All right, hurry!

00:38.621 --> 00:40.331
- Hurry up! Come on!
- [car door slides open]

00:41.041 --> 00:42.500
[sirens continue]

00:43.418 --> 00:46.046
- [boy 3] Come on, come on, come on!
- [boy 2] Let's get outta here!

00:47.213 --> 00:48.757
[sirens continue]

00:52.719 --> 00:54.220
[ringing tone]

01:00.852 --> 01:03.438
KIM GIL-SU

01:07.150 --> 01:10.653
- Hey, hyeong. Sorry, my battery was dead.
- Don't fucking bullshit me.

01:10.737 --> 01:12.197
Tell me where you are!

01:13.323 --> 01:16.201
[spluttering] Hey, it's over.

01:16.284 --> 01:20.080
So you better come to Mangu-dong
with Yeong-i, that fucking bitch.

01:20.914 --> 01:22.540
[Gil-su breathing heavily]

01:24.793 --> 01:26.211
Seong-chan is here.

01:28.213 --> 01:29.756
You better fucking hurry.

01:30.548 --> 01:32.842
Or else I'm gonna
sell him somewhere. Got it?

01:35.303 --> 01:36.346
Yes.

01:36.429 --> 01:37.514
[phone beeps]

01:42.143 --> 01:44.354
Seong-chan? What'd he say?

01:50.568 --> 01:52.612
[Seok-dae] I need to get going.
You stay here.

01:54.280 --> 01:55.907
Rent out a room for a few days.

01:56.616 --> 01:58.159
[Yeong-i] Where are you going?

02:00.495 --> 02:01.579
[Seok-dae] Don't follow me.

02:03.623 --> 02:04.499
Oppa!

02:08.628 --> 02:10.421
- [sighs]
- [phone buzzing]

02:11.172 --> 02:13.633
ASSHOLE

02:13.716 --> 02:15.718
[tense music continues]

02:19.764 --> 02:21.474
What happened? What's going on?

02:22.142 --> 02:25.186
I'm at the address you gave me,
but no one's here.

02:25.687 --> 02:27.105
[breathing shakily]

02:29.399 --> 02:32.902
And those shitheads took Su-ho,
didn't they?

02:33.945 --> 02:36.614
Send me a friend request on WithMap,
like right now.

02:36.698 --> 02:37.866
What?

02:38.658 --> 02:39.868
[Yeong-i] You don't have it?

02:41.619 --> 02:43.788
WithMap's on the app store. Download it.

02:43.872 --> 02:46.875
It's a location-sharing app,
so get it and follow me.

02:48.251 --> 02:49.210
[grunts softly]

02:50.211 --> 02:52.922
- Where are you going?
- [Yeong-i] I don't know yet.

02:54.549 --> 02:56.176
Make sure you bring the police.

02:57.343 --> 02:59.095
Or we're really gonna die.

03:01.014 --> 03:02.056
Okay.

03:04.976 --> 03:05.852
[phone beeps]

03:07.437 --> 03:08.313
Oppa!

03:10.732 --> 03:12.317
I'm not letting you go alone.

03:14.235 --> 03:15.570
I'm coming with you.

03:20.450 --> 03:22.452
[tense music continues]

03:28.124 --> 03:29.292
[Su-ho] It's all right, 'kay?

03:30.001 --> 03:32.253
- Bye.
- [Beom-seok] Why's Su-ho going alone?

03:32.337 --> 03:34.672
What are we gonna do?
What if something happens?

03:39.427 --> 03:40.678
[phone buzzes]

03:42.222 --> 03:44.224
YEONG-I:
COME TO MANGU-DONG FIRST

03:44.307 --> 03:46.017
YOUR FRIENDS ARE THERE

03:53.399 --> 03:54.734
[music fades]

03:54.817 --> 03:56.819
["Hero" by Meego playing]

04:10.416 --> 04:15.546
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

05:08.558 --> 05:10.560
[birdsong]

05:12.437 --> 05:14.439
[ominous music playing]

05:23.448 --> 05:24.699
[Seok-dae sighs]

05:26.117 --> 05:27.493
You're so annoying.

05:27.577 --> 05:29.412
How long are you gonna follow me?

05:29.495 --> 05:31.039
[Yeong-i] Hey, knock it off.

05:50.016 --> 05:51.392
[Su-ho inhales]

05:51.476 --> 05:53.144
[exhales]

05:53.853 --> 05:54.979
[Beom-seok] Su-ho-ya.

05:56.481 --> 05:57.690
[Su-ho exhales]

05:58.858 --> 06:00.777
[grunts]

06:01.277 --> 06:03.237
- [sighs]
- You all right?

06:05.948 --> 06:07.492
Hey, how'd you, uh…

06:08.034 --> 06:09.410
how'd you end up here?

06:09.494 --> 06:12.038
- I thought that you might be in trouble.
- Oh.

06:12.121 --> 06:13.373
I was kinda worried.

06:14.123 --> 06:16.084
I went to that guy's house
to give him the money,

06:16.667 --> 06:18.127
but then they took me here.

06:18.753 --> 06:19.712
Oh.

06:19.796 --> 06:21.672
[chuckles]

06:21.756 --> 06:24.550
Hey, that warms me up
like doganitang. Wow.

06:24.634 --> 06:26.511
- Hey, hey.
- [Su-ho] I could go for a drink.

06:26.594 --> 06:28.930
Hey, assholes.
Shut your fucking mouths, all right?

06:29.013 --> 06:31.933
Hey, let us talk over here.

06:32.016 --> 06:34.852
I'm sad enough as it is,
being tied up like this.

06:34.936 --> 06:37.188
- Smoking's really bad for your health.
- You keep talking.

06:37.271 --> 06:38.439
Oh shit.

06:41.901 --> 06:43.194
[Yeong-i sighs]

06:43.277 --> 06:44.362
ASSHOLE

06:44.445 --> 06:45.655
- [bleeping]
- [Seok-dae] Yeong-a.

06:47.031 --> 06:48.032
Yeah?

06:50.618 --> 06:51.953
Remember to stay quiet.

06:52.995 --> 06:53.996
Don't act up.

06:55.540 --> 06:56.416
[sighs]

06:56.916 --> 06:58.709
You always say the same thing.

06:59.293 --> 07:00.211
I'm sorry.

07:01.254 --> 07:03.798
It's my fault we got involved
with Gil-su to begin with.

07:04.632 --> 07:07.218
This wouldn't have happened
if you hadn't followed me.

07:10.012 --> 07:10.847
Hey.

07:13.099 --> 07:14.684
Do you like me?

07:18.479 --> 07:19.689
Don't be an idiot.

07:41.961 --> 07:43.963
- [bleep]
- [ringing tone]

07:48.134 --> 07:49.135
[Si-eun] Hello?

07:49.969 --> 07:51.888
I just made a report about Mangu-dong.

07:52.763 --> 07:53.764
Are you on your way?

07:54.849 --> 07:56.851
[ominous music continues]

08:04.525 --> 08:05.610
[sighs]

08:06.110 --> 08:06.944
Come here.

08:17.163 --> 08:18.164
Hey, Seok-dae-ya.

08:18.831 --> 08:22.084
Did I… do something to hurt your feelings?

08:23.711 --> 08:25.546
I fed you and housed you.

08:25.630 --> 08:29.258
I mean, I even paid you a lot of money.

08:29.759 --> 08:30.718
Why?

08:31.219 --> 08:33.846
Did your heart get soft because
you got a family of your own?

08:34.347 --> 08:35.515
I'll take the beating, hyeong.

08:36.891 --> 08:37.975
[Gil-su] Mm-mm-mm.

08:39.393 --> 08:40.811
I was just curious.

08:45.107 --> 08:46.275
Get it over with.

08:51.364 --> 08:52.198
All right.

08:53.574 --> 08:55.326
Take the beating then, asshole.

08:55.868 --> 08:56.702
[grunting]

09:02.375 --> 09:03.292
[metal clanks]

09:04.377 --> 09:06.796
You piece of shit. Huh?

09:06.879 --> 09:09.423
Fuck. You shithead motherfucker!

09:10.174 --> 09:11.384
[grunts]

09:11.467 --> 09:12.510
Oppa!

09:12.593 --> 09:14.387
[Gil-su panting]

09:15.805 --> 09:17.098
Oppa, please don't.

09:17.181 --> 09:19.642
Bitch! So you… you did it.

09:19.725 --> 09:21.018
You're responsible for this.

09:23.145 --> 09:25.356
Hey, take this bitch and get rid of her.

09:27.108 --> 09:28.401
- [bar clangs]
- Get off!

09:29.318 --> 09:31.821
- [blow lands]
- [Yeong-i] Let go, you fucking assholes!

09:31.904 --> 09:33.656
- [bar clatters]
- [Yeong-i] Let go of me!

09:33.739 --> 09:35.366
- Get your grubby hands off me!
- [grunting]

09:35.449 --> 09:36.742
[Gil-su exhales]

09:36.826 --> 09:37.910
Hey, Seong-chan-a.

09:40.496 --> 09:41.581
Hey, Seong-chan-a!

09:44.458 --> 09:45.459
[sighs]

09:45.543 --> 09:46.919
[ominous music continues]

09:47.795 --> 09:49.547
You're turning 14 this year, right?

09:50.840 --> 09:51.757
Yes.

09:53.134 --> 09:54.135
[Gil-su chuckles]

09:57.638 --> 09:59.974
So you stab those guys then, all right?

10:07.148 --> 10:09.358
- Don't be such a coward.
- [breathing shakily]

10:09.442 --> 10:12.069
[Gil-su] You're a minor.
You won't get thrown in jail.

10:12.153 --> 10:13.821
Ugh, I'm anxious.

10:21.037 --> 10:23.789
JUNGNANG-GU
YEONG-I

10:23.873 --> 10:25.583
[bleeping]

10:25.666 --> 10:26.834
[exhales]

10:28.294 --> 10:31.964
[Gil-su singing]
♪ Which one of you should I stab? ♪

10:32.048 --> 10:33.591
Eenie, meenie,

10:33.674 --> 10:35.176
minie,

10:36.177 --> 10:37.011
moe.

10:40.514 --> 10:43.684
Ding, dong, ding… dong.

10:44.310 --> 10:46.312
[all laughing]

10:47.355 --> 10:48.564
Hey, man.

10:49.065 --> 10:51.192
Let's work something out.

10:52.109 --> 10:53.736
Shut your mouth.

10:53.819 --> 10:55.905
Yeah? This might sting a little.

10:55.988 --> 10:56.822
Okay?

11:03.079 --> 11:04.580
[groaning]

11:04.664 --> 11:07.667
Enough is enough, goddamn piece of shit.

11:07.750 --> 11:09.210
- [Su-ho] Whoa.
- [Gil-su grunting]

11:09.293 --> 11:10.336
[panting]

11:10.419 --> 11:11.504
[coughs]

11:12.046 --> 11:12.880
[Yeong-i] Oppa!

11:14.382 --> 11:16.717
- Everybody stay still, or I will kill you.
- [Gil-su groans]

11:16.801 --> 11:18.803
[Gil-su panting]

11:22.390 --> 11:24.350
Let's go, one on one, you and me.

11:24.433 --> 11:27.478
- [Gil-su chuckles] Fucking shit.
- If I win, you leave us alone.

11:27.561 --> 11:30.356
What, you take me for a punk-ass bitch?

11:33.401 --> 11:34.860
You asshole. Fuck you.

11:37.697 --> 11:38.864
Fuckin' bitch.

11:41.200 --> 11:43.953
Hey! Let go of me, you fucking shithead!

11:44.036 --> 11:46.455
Ha! Come here. Fuck.

11:46.539 --> 11:48.749
Goddamn asshole!

11:48.833 --> 11:51.043
- I gave you food and a place to stay!
- Fucker!

11:51.127 --> 11:52.461
- Right?
- [Seok-dae grunts]

11:58.676 --> 11:59.885
[Gil-su groans]

12:00.386 --> 12:01.679
Damn it.

12:02.263 --> 12:04.724
Stop before you really
get your ass beat to hell.

12:04.807 --> 12:07.226
[laughs] Goddamn!

12:09.520 --> 12:11.105
Ha! Aah.

12:15.818 --> 12:17.611
[Seok-dae grunts]

12:21.198 --> 12:23.617
[Gil-su laughs] Hey, Seok-dae-ya.

12:23.701 --> 12:26.495
Are you at least havin' fun? Huh?

12:27.163 --> 12:29.540
- You know that you'll never beat me.
- [groans]

12:29.623 --> 12:32.376
Because your big dumbass
heart gets in the way.

12:32.460 --> 12:33.586
- You piece of--
- [grunts]

12:35.963 --> 12:37.256
[Gil-su groans]

12:37.840 --> 12:38.716
Fuck.

12:38.799 --> 12:41.135
- You dumb bitch.
- You hit him from behind?

12:41.218 --> 12:43.471
Enough is enough, you goddamn fuckers!

12:43.554 --> 12:46.474
- You fucking bitch, I'll--
- You wanna fuck around and find out?

12:46.557 --> 12:47.600
[boy 1 chuckles]

12:48.184 --> 12:49.143
Oh!

12:49.727 --> 12:51.187
Get Seok-dae oppa.

12:51.270 --> 12:53.439
- [Gil-su groans]
- [Yeong-i] Hey, don't move.

12:53.522 --> 12:56.734
- [boy 2] Fucking bitch.
- Hey, stay where you are, asshole!

12:56.817 --> 12:58.402
[Gil-su moaning]

12:59.236 --> 13:01.238
- Oh my God.
- [Gil-su] Agh, one sec. Hold on.

13:02.031 --> 13:03.991
- Agh. I'm bleeding.
- [panting]

13:04.074 --> 13:05.367
Just a minute.

13:05.451 --> 13:07.578
- [Yeong-i yelps]
- [Gil-su] Goddamn bitch.

13:07.661 --> 13:09.789
- [Gil-su] You fucking bitch.
- [knife clatters]

13:10.372 --> 13:11.916
- Die, you little shit.
- [yelps]

13:12.541 --> 13:13.626
[grunts]

13:14.752 --> 13:17.838
Ever since Seok-dae fucking met you…

13:18.339 --> 13:19.340
Die.

13:23.677 --> 13:25.429
[Yeong-i] Shit. Stop it.

13:26.430 --> 13:28.182
- Hold up.
- [boy 2] Hyeong! Hyeong!

13:28.265 --> 13:30.559
- [Gil-su grunts]
- [siren blaring in distance]

13:30.643 --> 13:32.603
[Yeong-i coughing and gasping]

13:33.521 --> 13:35.105
[whimpering]

13:37.900 --> 13:39.652
[coughing]

13:43.155 --> 13:45.699
- [Si-eun sighs]
- [Gil-su scoffs] Fuck.

13:46.534 --> 13:48.452
I thought you were a dumbass kid.

13:48.994 --> 13:51.914
But you're freakin' brave, aren't you?

13:53.082 --> 13:55.167
It's over. The police are here.

13:56.168 --> 13:58.212
They'll probably search
your car down there.

13:58.295 --> 13:59.630
Goddamn it.

13:59.713 --> 14:01.048
- [boy 3] Shit.
- [boy 2] Let's go.

14:01.632 --> 14:03.092
[wheezing]

14:04.969 --> 14:06.470
[coughing] Are you okay?

14:07.471 --> 14:09.265
[siren continues in distance]

14:09.348 --> 14:11.767
Si-eun-a, what's going on?

14:12.893 --> 14:14.186
[Si-eun] I'm sorry I'm late.

14:15.938 --> 14:18.315
- [Su-ho] We almost died. Can you untie us?
- Yeah.

14:20.818 --> 14:22.862
[groans] Ow, my arms.

14:22.945 --> 14:24.655
- [Si-eun] Let's get outta here.
- [laughs]

14:25.781 --> 14:27.032
[sighs] Nice.

14:29.869 --> 14:33.163
[groans] I'm never coming back
to an amusement park.

14:33.247 --> 14:34.957
- [siren getting louder]
- [chuckles]

14:35.040 --> 14:36.083
[sighs]

14:37.209 --> 14:38.294
Hey, why are they back?

14:38.377 --> 14:39.670
[Gil-su] For fuck's sake.

14:42.131 --> 14:43.090
Hey.

14:43.173 --> 14:46.594
- [siren sound effect continues]
- You think that you're so smart, don't ya?

14:46.677 --> 14:50.055
These little fucking kids,
trying to trick me?

14:50.639 --> 14:51.515
Fuck.

14:52.516 --> 14:55.102
I'm done playing your game. Go get them!

14:55.185 --> 14:56.770
Aw, man, you should've told us.

14:56.854 --> 14:58.647
[dramatic music playing]

14:59.481 --> 15:00.774
[boy 2] Kick their ass!

15:01.817 --> 15:03.193
[grunting]

15:04.320 --> 15:05.446
[both grunting]

15:06.697 --> 15:07.615
[yells]

15:08.949 --> 15:09.867
[grunting]

15:14.079 --> 15:15.080
Here we go.

15:21.253 --> 15:23.505
Yeong-a. Let's go.

15:24.298 --> 15:25.257
We have to go.

15:27.885 --> 15:29.803
[all panting]

15:33.140 --> 15:34.391
Huh? The police.

15:34.475 --> 15:36.393
- [officer 1] What?
- [Yeong-i] What are you doing?

15:36.477 --> 15:38.354
- [Seok-dae] You gotta leave.
- [officer 1] Kids!

15:40.689 --> 15:41.899
[boy 1 grunts] Come here!

15:45.444 --> 15:49.114
- You psycho son of a bitch.
- [boy 3] You stupid fuckin' asshole.

15:51.075 --> 15:52.618
- [Gil-su] Move aside.
- [boy 2] Fuck.

15:54.578 --> 15:56.080
- [Si-eun gasps]
- [blade rings]

15:56.163 --> 15:57.456
[Gil-su laughs]

15:58.874 --> 16:03.087
Did you think I wouldn't stab you
just because you were a kid? Huh?

16:04.213 --> 16:07.716
That's why you should've given me
the money when I asked for it,

16:07.800 --> 16:09.093
you little shit.

16:10.135 --> 16:11.887
Yeah? Huh?

16:13.639 --> 16:14.932
- [gunshot]
- [gasps]

16:15.557 --> 16:16.558
[officer 1] Don't move!

16:17.142 --> 16:18.102
Hands up!

16:18.602 --> 16:19.770
- [boy 1 coughs]
- [radio bleeps]

16:19.853 --> 16:21.689
[officer 1] Number 220, this is 43.

16:21.772 --> 16:25.275
- Suspects in report 2917 in an assault…
- You fucking little prick.

16:25.359 --> 16:27.277
- Next time, you're dead.
- [officer 1] This is 43.

16:27.361 --> 16:29.697
- [radio] Stay where you are.
- All suspects in… Don't move!

16:29.780 --> 16:31.991
I think there's some kind
of misunderstanding.

16:32.074 --> 16:34.660
- These are live bullets.
- [radio chatter]

16:34.743 --> 16:36.370
Oh, we're cooperating, sir.

16:37.496 --> 16:38.706
- Right?
- [boy 3] Uh-huh.

16:39.331 --> 16:41.667
Wait, didn't we play soccer
together last month…

16:41.750 --> 16:42.793
[boy 2 yelps]

16:42.876 --> 16:45.129
- [grunting and panting]
- [officer 1] Nobody move.

16:45.212 --> 16:46.672
- Hey, hey, hey.
- I'm not.

16:46.755 --> 16:48.298
- [boy 3 yelps]
- [officer 1] Stay still.

16:51.969 --> 16:53.178
Hey. Hey!

16:53.262 --> 16:54.179
Yeon Si-eun!

16:54.763 --> 16:56.181
- Where are you going?
- [boy 3 groans]

16:57.141 --> 16:59.101
[dramatic music playing]

17:21.874 --> 17:23.375
[panting]

17:28.547 --> 17:30.132
[music fades]

17:30.215 --> 17:31.383
[Gil-su gasps] You scared me.

17:32.259 --> 17:35.054
Oh, fuck, this is
some fucking bullshit, man.

17:35.137 --> 17:36.513
I hate this.

17:36.597 --> 17:39.475
Hey, why you fuckin' following
me around? Huh?

17:40.059 --> 17:41.852
[panting]

17:46.440 --> 17:48.692
[menacing music playing]

17:48.776 --> 17:50.778
[Gil-su] Jeez, this stupid little kid.

17:55.783 --> 17:57.534
You're fuckin' impossible,
you little prick.

18:01.121 --> 18:02.289
Ha!

18:04.750 --> 18:05.959
[Si-eun coughs]

18:06.043 --> 18:06.960
[Gil-su laughs]

18:09.630 --> 18:11.340
[sighs] Where should I stab you?

18:12.299 --> 18:13.133
Huh?

18:14.134 --> 18:14.968
Huh?

18:17.387 --> 18:18.388
[Su-ho] Hey!

18:19.890 --> 18:20.766
[Si-eun coughs]

18:24.895 --> 18:25.979
Ah.

18:26.772 --> 18:30.109
Guess I gotta kick your ass. [sighs]

18:31.068 --> 18:33.445
Why have you both been coming
after me all day?

18:33.529 --> 18:35.656
Shit, man, I'm so sick of this crap.

18:35.739 --> 18:36.907
Well?

18:37.449 --> 18:38.492
Come on.

18:40.285 --> 18:41.453
[dramatic music playing]

18:42.121 --> 18:43.497
[Gil-su grunts and laughs]

18:44.081 --> 18:46.542
- You're pretty good, kid.
- [Su-ho] Yeah, and you're slow.

18:49.920 --> 18:51.463
[Gil-su] Shit! Hey!

18:54.550 --> 18:55.425
Hey!

18:56.885 --> 18:58.887
[both grunting]

19:02.182 --> 19:03.308
[Su-ho grunts]

19:06.061 --> 19:07.146
That's it?

19:20.784 --> 19:21.827
[Gil-su yells]

19:22.494 --> 19:24.121
- Oh, man.
- [Su-ho] Yah!

19:26.456 --> 19:28.250
[blows landing]

19:30.544 --> 19:33.130
[both grunting]

19:37.509 --> 19:38.677
[Gil-su laughs]

19:39.720 --> 19:41.013
- [groans]
- [Su-ho] Eat shit.

19:43.182 --> 19:44.641
[music stops]

19:44.725 --> 19:46.560
[Su-ho and Si-eun panting]

19:52.858 --> 19:55.611
Hey, have you lost your mind or what?

19:57.696 --> 19:59.448
Why would you go by yourself, huh?

20:01.575 --> 20:03.118
- You came.
- [Su-ho sighs]

20:03.202 --> 20:04.536
[chuckles]

20:04.620 --> 20:08.415
Wow, what a load of shit.
You know, you really are a psycho.

20:09.166 --> 20:10.125
Yeah?

20:13.378 --> 20:14.838
I'm not the only one.

20:15.339 --> 20:16.340
[Su-ho] Aah.

20:17.216 --> 20:19.426
You won't let me have the last word,
will you?

20:20.135 --> 20:21.303
If I were you,

20:22.221 --> 20:23.347
I'd let me win.

20:24.556 --> 20:25.891
You psycho.

20:26.600 --> 20:28.352
[laughs]

20:28.435 --> 20:29.811
[both panting]

20:32.898 --> 20:34.816
[siren wailing in distance]

20:36.944 --> 20:38.946
[buckle clinking]

20:40.948 --> 20:42.950
[Yeong-i panting]

20:43.033 --> 20:45.035
- [gasps] Come here.
- [Seok-dae] Goddamn it.

20:45.118 --> 20:46.745
[siren approaching]

20:50.457 --> 20:52.251
What are you doing?

20:52.834 --> 20:54.419
Stop messing around!

20:54.503 --> 20:55.545
- [panting]
- [Seok-dae] Go.

20:55.629 --> 20:57.172
- You must go.
- Stop this bullshit.

20:57.256 --> 20:59.716
- Come with us!
- Fucking listen to me, Yeong-a!

21:01.134 --> 21:02.844
- [whimpers]
- [Seok-dae] Go.

21:03.595 --> 21:04.805
It's not your fault.

21:04.888 --> 21:06.598
[gasps] You're really…

21:07.766 --> 21:10.185
- [Seong-chan] Let's go, noona.
- Uh… hey! [weeping]

21:10.269 --> 21:12.604
- [Seong-chan] Come on!
- Hey! Fuck this! Hey!

21:13.438 --> 21:16.650
You're so annoying! Hey! Jeon Seok-dae!

21:17.359 --> 21:19.236
- I can't believe you!
- [officer 2] Young man.

21:19.319 --> 21:20.529
Put your hands up.

21:21.947 --> 21:24.032
- I said hands up.
- [sirens growing louder]

21:27.369 --> 21:28.745
[boy 1] Let me fucking go!

21:30.122 --> 21:31.707
- I told you everything!
- [boy 2] Let go!

21:31.790 --> 21:33.417
- Let me go!
- Shut up and cooperate.

21:33.500 --> 21:35.711
Get your hands off me! I'm cooperating!

21:35.794 --> 21:37.879
- [Gil-su] How humiliating. Shit.
- [officer 1] Come on!

21:37.963 --> 21:39.256
- [sighs]
- [radio chatter]

21:39.339 --> 21:41.133
- [officer 2] Stop resisting.
- [Gil-su] I'm not!

21:43.218 --> 21:44.678
[siren blaring]

21:46.888 --> 21:48.265
[Gil-su] I'm coming for ya

21:49.933 --> 21:51.184
when I'm out, 'kay?

21:51.935 --> 21:52.936
Yeah?

22:02.446 --> 22:04.197
Damn it! Fuck!

22:04.281 --> 22:05.574
- What's goin' on?
- [Gil-su groans]

22:05.657 --> 22:08.160
Let's not cross paths anymore,
you fucking dick.

22:08.994 --> 22:10.078
[Gil-su] Shit.

22:10.162 --> 22:11.371
[groans]

22:13.206 --> 22:14.791
Aah, doganitang.

22:15.792 --> 22:17.878
Ah, I'm so hungry, seriously.

22:17.961 --> 22:19.629
Doganitang. Aah.

22:21.214 --> 22:23.050
Do you have a tapeworm or something?

22:23.133 --> 22:27.596
The moment I thought about doganitang,
I just couldn't get it out of my mind.

22:27.679 --> 22:30.307
- With kkakdugi. Oh, man.
- [Beom-seok] Here you guys are.

22:32.017 --> 22:35.228
What? What a relief! You're still alive.

22:36.021 --> 22:37.647
I thought this guy was dead.

22:38.148 --> 22:41.360
Well, after you two left, I went
looking for Si-eun's phone and stuff,

22:41.443 --> 22:44.363
but I couldn't see anything,
so I took a while.

22:44.446 --> 22:46.281
- [rustling]
- Here.

22:51.328 --> 22:52.996
The screen's a little broken. [chuckles]

22:54.039 --> 22:54.956
Thanks.

22:56.458 --> 22:57.876
[man] Uh, Yeon Si-eun-gun?

22:59.294 --> 23:01.505
We need you to come
to the station to make a statement.

23:03.507 --> 23:04.591
Your friend too.

23:08.970 --> 23:12.599
SEOUL SEOCHO POLICE STATION

23:12.682 --> 23:14.768
- [clamoring]
- [boy] You have no right to arrest me!

23:14.851 --> 23:17.104
- [officer 1] Calm the hell down.
- [officer 2] Sit down.

23:38.792 --> 23:40.127
I'm sorry.

23:42.421 --> 23:45.090
- What?
- You were right.

23:46.133 --> 23:47.634
Because of me, Su-ho…

23:49.511 --> 23:50.554
Sorry.

23:52.472 --> 23:54.433
Don't say that.

23:54.516 --> 23:58.728
You were late
because I took the taxi alone.

23:59.563 --> 24:00.856
I'm sorry too.

24:00.939 --> 24:02.941
[footsteps approaching in corridor]

24:20.000 --> 24:21.418
[sighs]

24:21.501 --> 24:23.378
The superintendent and I made a deal.

24:23.879 --> 24:26.131
It will be… our little secret.

24:27.132 --> 24:29.551
You both are
completely irrelevant to this case.

24:32.095 --> 24:33.013
What?

24:35.807 --> 24:39.227
Si-eun-gun, your family doesn't need
to be made aware of this.

24:43.940 --> 24:45.192
You should go home.

25:05.670 --> 25:07.005
Excuse me.

25:09.132 --> 25:12.802
The only person who did anything wrong
was the man named Kim Gil-su.

25:13.887 --> 25:15.680
He blackmailed and exploited everybody.

25:18.099 --> 25:20.936
I'd appreciate it
if you showed them mercy.

25:27.067 --> 25:28.777
Okay. Go on home.

25:35.784 --> 25:36.826
[sighs]

25:36.910 --> 25:39.663
Did you keep it a secret from my father?

25:40.664 --> 25:41.623
No.

25:43.124 --> 25:44.626
We should head out too.

25:48.338 --> 25:49.339
I mean…

25:50.382 --> 25:52.884
[sighs] I asked you
to keep it a secret from him.

25:55.720 --> 25:56.888
Let's go.

26:02.102 --> 26:03.395
[shudders]

26:05.313 --> 26:07.482
- [officer] Is that so?
- [murmur of voices]

26:08.483 --> 26:10.610
- [boy] I'm telling you.
- I heard you.

26:10.694 --> 26:14.030
- [boy] You have to understand.
- [officer] That's why I'm listening.

26:14.114 --> 26:15.490
Hey, psycho.

26:20.161 --> 26:21.746
Let's grab a bite to eat sometime.

26:25.125 --> 26:26.960
Why do you all love food so much?

26:30.755 --> 26:32.757
[siren wailing in distance]

26:39.556 --> 26:41.391
[insects chirping]

26:58.283 --> 26:59.701
- [Si-eun] What's up?
- [sighs]

27:02.412 --> 27:03.538
How's Seok-dae oppa?

27:04.581 --> 27:06.249
He's being questioned inside.

27:09.878 --> 27:10.920
He'll be fine.

27:14.966 --> 27:16.301
What about the others?

27:19.471 --> 27:21.056
I can't reach anyone.

27:22.015 --> 27:23.642
The youngest one went home.

27:29.105 --> 27:30.231
And you?

27:45.288 --> 27:47.957
[Gil-su] Hey. What the hell?

27:50.669 --> 27:51.670
Huh?

27:53.838 --> 27:56.383
The assemblyman wanted you
to give that man an eye for an eye.

27:57.509 --> 27:59.052
- Sorry?
- [Gil-su laughs]

27:59.135 --> 28:01.096
This is the police station.

28:01.971 --> 28:04.224
- You're beating someone here?
- Go ahead.

28:05.809 --> 28:07.227
Uh… I'm all right.

28:07.310 --> 28:08.520
[laughs]

28:08.603 --> 28:10.897
Bullshit fuckin' idiots. Fuck this.

28:11.690 --> 28:13.024
[yells]

28:13.108 --> 28:14.192
[groans]

28:14.693 --> 28:16.486
- [man] Hey.
- [Gil-su groaning]

28:16.569 --> 28:17.445
[tense music playing]

28:17.529 --> 28:19.739
Stay still. Don't move a muscle.

28:20.448 --> 28:22.075
- [Gil-su sighs]
- Now, watch what I do.

28:22.158 --> 28:23.034
[Gil-su groans]

28:23.118 --> 28:25.704
One, two. Okay? One, two.

28:26.538 --> 28:27.539
[yelps]

28:27.622 --> 28:28.957
- [thump]
- [Gil-su moans]

28:29.040 --> 28:32.001
That… hurts… [moans]

28:32.919 --> 28:34.629
- [man sighs]
- [Gil-su groans]

28:34.713 --> 28:37.215
Use your imagination,
like you're hitting a punching bag.

28:37.298 --> 28:39.634
[Gil-su laughs weakly] Okay. Hit me.

28:39.718 --> 28:42.178
Dumb fuck. Hey, Maltese.

28:42.262 --> 28:44.472
Come at me like your friends did. [sighs]

28:44.556 --> 28:46.599
- Wait, never mind. [laughs]
- [thump]

28:46.683 --> 28:49.144
[Gil-su] You're just their minion.
You're not their friend.

28:49.227 --> 28:52.147
You're some kind of little fucking coward
compared to those guys.

28:52.230 --> 28:54.190
All right, you fuckin' asshole.

28:54.941 --> 28:56.609
Hey, hit me.

28:57.527 --> 28:58.403
Do it!

28:58.987 --> 29:00.989
Come on, hit me! Do it!

29:01.990 --> 29:03.867
[music intensifying]

29:05.618 --> 29:06.786
[music fades]

29:09.998 --> 29:10.874
[clattering]

29:16.755 --> 29:18.298
[door slides open]

29:20.633 --> 29:22.343
[footsteps approaching]

29:27.766 --> 29:28.975
[Su-ho sighs]

29:30.351 --> 29:31.269
Hmm?

29:35.982 --> 29:36.983
[Si-eun] Well,

29:37.817 --> 29:39.527
she wanted to apologize.

29:40.320 --> 29:41.279
Hello!

29:44.532 --> 29:48.828
Wait. You don't seem like someone
who's here to apologize.

29:50.121 --> 29:51.247
My bad.

29:52.373 --> 29:53.416
[chuckles]

29:54.626 --> 29:56.252
You're nuts. [groans]

29:56.836 --> 29:58.004
How did it go with you?

29:59.714 --> 30:03.426
I don't know if it's a good thing,
but Beom-seok's family's covering it up.

30:04.093 --> 30:07.639
They took our names out of the case.
And Kim Gil-su's detained.

30:08.223 --> 30:12.685
[sighs] Is Beom-seok's dad
a chairman of some place?

30:12.769 --> 30:14.854
His family's secretary or whoever came by

30:14.938 --> 30:16.981
and said they'd pay
my whole hospital bill.

30:17.065 --> 30:20.109
I declined,
but should I have just accepted it?

30:20.610 --> 30:21.444
[laughs]

30:21.528 --> 30:23.738
He's an assemblyman. Oh Jin-won.

30:26.032 --> 30:27.116
Wow.

30:28.952 --> 30:29.994
[winces]

30:30.537 --> 30:31.704
[sighs]

30:33.122 --> 30:34.624
How long will you be in here?

30:35.458 --> 30:38.461
I'll be discharged tomorrow.
It's a light fracture.

30:39.587 --> 30:41.714
Then, like, can I sleep here tonight?

30:41.798 --> 30:44.092
- [Su-ho] Yeah, do what you want.
- All right!

30:44.175 --> 30:46.219
[quirky music playing]

30:46.928 --> 30:48.763
Hey, you were freaking cool back there.

30:49.597 --> 30:52.267
- Yeah, I'm pretty cool.
- Yeah, I got goosebumps.

30:52.350 --> 30:54.686
[high-pitched] "You wanna fuck around
and find out?"

30:54.769 --> 30:58.147
- [both chuckle]
- "Enough's enough, you goddamn fuckers!"

30:58.231 --> 30:59.107
[laughs]

30:59.190 --> 31:01.526
Why are you copying me, idiot?
Did you fall in love?

31:02.193 --> 31:03.194
Enough's enough.

31:04.195 --> 31:06.155
Too bad, so sad. I'm Si-eun's.

31:10.451 --> 31:11.411
Are you two dating?

31:11.494 --> 31:12.996
That's not happening.

31:13.872 --> 31:15.415
That's not happening?

31:15.498 --> 31:17.667
We know where each other's at
at all times.

31:18.501 --> 31:21.170
That's just that app's main function.

31:21.754 --> 31:24.048
You should just date each other.
You'd make a cute couple.

31:24.132 --> 31:25.884
- Enough's enough.
- [Yeong-i giggles]

31:27.010 --> 31:28.678
Ah! You little shit.

31:28.761 --> 31:30.138
[music fades]

31:38.938 --> 31:40.773
- [door opens]
- [lock bleeps]

31:44.360 --> 31:46.362
- [door closes]
- [lock bleeps]

31:47.614 --> 31:48.990
- [lock turns]
- [alarm bleeps]

31:49.073 --> 31:49.949
[sighs]

31:51.159 --> 31:52.535
[clock ticking]

31:59.167 --> 32:01.169
- [footsteps approaching]
- [rustling]

32:05.173 --> 32:06.966
Huh? What?

32:12.263 --> 32:13.431
[both] What's this?

32:14.349 --> 32:15.558
You were craving it.

32:21.898 --> 32:24.025
Ugh, I'll gain weight eating this late.

32:24.692 --> 32:27.654
Huh? Wow, look at how late it is.

32:28.738 --> 32:30.740
You are so inconsiderate.

32:31.240 --> 32:33.785
I guess I should eat some just to be nice.

32:33.868 --> 32:35.870
Wow, it looks amazing! [giggling]

32:35.954 --> 32:37.038
What is this feeling?

32:37.914 --> 32:39.457
I just got the chills.

32:40.458 --> 32:41.334
What's with you?

32:43.336 --> 32:45.755
- What do you mean?
- I mean you.

32:47.256 --> 32:49.467
You're being way too sweet.

32:49.550 --> 32:51.386
Huh? Your eyes.

32:51.970 --> 32:53.680
The way you act, talk.

32:54.347 --> 32:55.515
And your face.

32:56.975 --> 32:58.434
It's making me cringe.

33:05.900 --> 33:06.901
[chuckles]

33:06.985 --> 33:08.486
["Self" by Meego playing]

33:09.570 --> 33:11.406
Huh? Huh?

33:23.167 --> 33:24.293
Eat your food.

33:32.343 --> 33:33.636
[Su-ho slurps]

33:34.137 --> 33:35.638
[sighs deeply]

33:42.937 --> 33:45.440
[Yeong-i] Si-eun,
you need to eat something too.

33:45.523 --> 33:46.649
[Su-ho groans happily]

33:49.610 --> 33:51.195
Are you a mind reader?

33:52.947 --> 33:54.073
[slurps]

33:58.036 --> 33:59.203
[music fades]

34:00.079 --> 34:04.584
Well, before I'm an assemblyman,
I'm also a citizen and a father

34:04.667 --> 34:09.714
and am naturally extremely interested
in the youth policies, obviously.

34:10.548 --> 34:12.300
- [papers rustling]
- [soft gasping]

34:15.928 --> 34:17.680
[muffled sobbing]

34:31.903 --> 34:33.112
What?

34:38.034 --> 34:39.660
[sighs]

34:41.496 --> 34:42.622
[exhales]

34:46.751 --> 34:50.296
Why did I ever bring you here?

34:51.422 --> 34:52.840
[sighs] You are…

34:55.802 --> 34:58.513
just the wrong kind of breed.

34:59.597 --> 35:01.140
[sighs] You know that?

35:01.808 --> 35:03.726
[melancholy music playing]

35:03.810 --> 35:05.144
[sobbing]

35:08.648 --> 35:10.233
[blow lands]

35:12.777 --> 35:13.778
[blow lands]

35:13.861 --> 35:15.363
[Beom-seok sobs]

35:17.865 --> 35:19.742
["Hero" by Meego playing]

35:30.169 --> 35:32.171
[lyrics in Korean]

36:19.594 --> 36:23.848
♪ You are my hero ♪

36:25.892 --> 36:30.479
♪ My little hero ♪

36:31.939 --> 36:36.694
♪ You are my hero ♪

36:37.987 --> 36:41.908
♪ My little hero… ♪

36:41.991 --> 36:43.993
[lyrics in Korean]

37:32.667 --> 37:37.463
♪ You are my hero ♪

37:38.798 --> 37:43.552
♪ My little hero… ♪

37:44.053 --> 37:45.680
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS
ARE FICTIONAL

37:45.763 --> 37:47.390
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL
